{"overview":"برای دوستان صمیمی بکی و هانتر، زندگی در مورد غلبه بر ترس‌ها و کنار زدن محدودیت‌هاست. اما پس از صعود از ارتفاع 2000 فوتی به بالای یک برج رادیویی دورافتاده و متروک، خود را گرفتار می‌بینند و راهی برای پایین آمدن ندارند. حال مهارت‌های تخصصی کوه‌نوردی بکی و هانتر در حالی به آزمون نهایی گذاشته می‌شود که آن‌ها به‌شدت برای تحمل آب و هوای بد، کمبود مایحتاج و ارتفاعات سرگیجه‌آور مبارزه می‌کنند.","tagline":"ترس به اوج جدیدی می‌رسد.","overview_en":"For best friends Becky and Hunter, life is all about conquering fears and pushing limits. But after they climb 2,000 feet to the top of a remote, abandoned radio tower, they find themselves stranded with no way down. Now Becky and Hunter's expert climbing skills will be put to the ultimate test as they desperately fight to survive the elements, a lack of supplies, and vertigo-inducing heights.","tagline_en":"Fear reaches new heights.","runtime":107,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Scott Mann"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US","GB"],"cast":[{"name":"Grace Caroline Currey","role":"Becky Connor","photo":"/6chZcnjWEiFfpmB6D5BR9YUeIs9.jpg"},{"name":"Virginia Gardner","role":"Shiloh Hunter","photo":"/1DnNysK267b0te48KCkUlTKoTzj.jpg"},{"name":"Mason Gooding","role":"Dan Connor","photo":"/bmlry1xqBzNgv8Chm783ss93Cvg.jpg"},{"name":"جفری دین مورگان","role":"James Conner","photo":"/m8bdrmh6ExDCGQ64E83mHg002YV.jpg","en":"Jeffrey Dean Morgan"},{"name":"Jasper Cole","role":"Steve","photo":"/18mmNj8eKPn9a1n3G0yvy650Bd8.jpg"},{"name":"Darrell Dennis","role":"Randy","photo":"/2jOo4B5Nn9oGuzgx1UfoQs0MMCj.jpg"},{"name":"Bamm Ericsen","role":"Police Officer","photo":""},{"name":"Julia Pace Mitchell","role":"Diner Server","photo":"/6iavMrm8BhUJiGpZDSKmfGKgpK6.jpg"},{"name":"Evie Mann","role":"Flower Girl","photo":""},{"name":"Joseph Mann","role":"Page Boy","photo":""},{"name":"Nick Lynes","role":"Confused Truck Driver","photo":""},{"name":"Branden Currey","role":"Bar Man","photo":""}],"trailer":"FNk7Cu4sJOs","watch":{"